// All handlers in sh3_decode.inc; keep this list in sync with the shared decoder.
// Pure handlers are one-cycle register/flag operations. The CV1000
// batched dispatcher may defer PC and cycle publication across these.
// Memory handlers may also defer publication after a guarded direct access.
